gwF(){return"No anomalies in the editing record"},
gwH(){return"No editing history available"},
gwC(){return"This input carries no editing history \u2014 pasted text, a PDF, or a file whose record was stripped. There is nothing to judge from origin here, only the text analysis itself."},
