xG(a,b){return a+" found no evidence this time, so it did not take part in the vote (role weight "+b+"%). This means it spotted no AI traces on its own axis \u2014 not that it considers the text human-written."},
xF(a,b){return a+" found only a weak directional signal. It is discounted for screening and does not count as threshold-qualified evidence (role weight cap "+b+"%)."},
yU(a){return"Only "+a+" produced a usable direction; the other engines turned up nothing this time. The conclusion rests on a single analysis axis, so treat its confidence accordingly."},
yT(a){return""+a+" further engine(s) ran but formed no directional signal, and were excluded so that 'nothing to report' is not miscounted as 'looks human-written'."},
gq9(){return"Perplexity was not used for this document: the perplexity model (DistilGPT2) was trained on English only, and on Chinese, Japanese or Korean text it measures byte predictability rather than language predictability. Measured on labelled data, it separates human from AI writing in those languages 0% of the time, so counting it would only manufacture false positives."},
o_(a){return"Baseline by language: "+a},
o2(a){return""+a+" earlier sample(s) carry no language tag and cannot join any language's baseline \u2014 the original text is not kept, so the language cannot be recovered after the fact. They will be replaced as new documents are analysed."},
md(a,b){return"Routed to \u201c"+a+"\u201d for this document: the variant you selected is not validated for "+b+", and this one is."},
ma(a,b){return"\u201c"+a+"\u201d is a multilingual model but has not been validated on "+b+", so treat its score as weaker evidence than a validated one."},
mb(a,b){return"\u201c"+a+"\u201d does not cover "+b+". Its score is shown for reference only and should not be read as evidence either way."},
gq4(){return"Perplexity was not used: the language of this document could not be determined, so there is no calibrated threshold to compare against. Guessing a language would mean applying the wrong scale \u2014 the mistake this check exists to prevent."},
